{"unit_id":"zzhzz__dsh-ask-peer#card-zh","repo":"zzhzz/dsh-ask-peer","commit":"e706e82c5203fc8a4f0f6af13a4c947125ab6524","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ask-peer 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的同事 agent 协作插件。它向 DSH 注册 ask_peer、ask_peers、peers_list、recommend_peer 等工具，并提供可配置的对等服务和 Web 设置界面。用户可以向已配置的同事 agent 提问、并行比较回答、查看同事的标签与会话主题，也能通过推荐流程发现新同伴并在界面确认添加。回答可基于指定会话上下文，插件还支持异步提问和待处理请求通知。适合希望让多个 DSH agent 分享专长、互相咨询的团队。需要配置同伴地址及共享令牌或公钥；本地身份密钥保存在 keyDir。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tool.ts:9-23","src/index.ts:101-115","src/client/index.ts:61-80"]}
{"unit_id":"zzhzz__dsh-ask-peer#card-en","repo":"zzhzz/dsh-ask-peer","commit":"e706e82c5203fc8a4f0f6af13a4c947125ab6524","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ask-peer lets DSH Web agents consult colleagues and discover peers. Tools ask agents, show peer tags and sessions, and request recommendations for approval. Answers can use a selected session; async asks and Web notifications are supported. Configure peer addresses and a token or public key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tool.ts:9-23","src/index.ts:101-115","src/client/index.ts:61-80"]}
